563_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tjYWesVcjuMQ7kNvwFHZFN1&_nc_oc=AdqT5dzVYc7Ow9okI3sPrEmCnkKLvmkj362eLr5-uxvErSO3kbjCR1XzTa3dovqJe1w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1OgLg4FEStaFnBuGi_tLCuNESq8Gbft8qg6-x5NYHMwQ&oe=69F8B1E7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImagequest.png", "id": "4881614211934802", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974671_4881614215268135_4455820547182218762_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nPmjbL_lE84Q7kNvwFvsZ3T&_nc_oc=AdpVbPkefeXG9xhxAAAqk51zJ9iJCc7oW-S9VrKn6ewGgbZh7iiuFkK-9y2v8cu_yII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0G-elaHiTV2icwlGCl1LNdffJmDQei6Gjk5JXgCHCkVQ&oe=69F8B6B5"}, "display_name": "System Critical: The Race Against Time ", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Your Name Is Cyborg 17,\n\nUpon Escaping The Facility Where you we\u2019re manufactured your internal program was Triggered setting your system into Critical self destruct mode. With just 24 hours left to live until self destruction In a Race against Time You must stay alive In a constant fight for survival to escape the evil forces that created you. It is time to embark on a journey to find a way to restore your system back to normal before it\u2019s too late\u2026", "short_description": "Old-School Retro Style Run and Gun Platformer Shooter in VR. Blast your arm cannon, use Grenades, Shields, and melee weapons, dodge Projectiles and make your way through the carefully crafted levels. Discover secret areas and destroy objects while Navigating obstacles and defeat bosses to progress "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iPN6n0rFHJQShXzpkUUEerYChKxmz3tGKFjXYXmWkhI/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Old Formulas ", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnN9teZkvVWRkEm7rCh0N